# Reminders in English.

## time at the end
@lang en
> Remind me to walk the dog at 5pm
= reminder "Walk the dog" 2026-11-10T17:00

## day and time first
@lang en
> Remind me at 9am tomorrow to call the dentist
= reminder "Call the dentist" 2026-11-11T09:00

## relative
@lang en
> Remind me in 30 minutes to check the oven
= reminder "Check the oven" 2026-11-10T16:30

## weekday
@lang en
> Set a reminder to email Sarah on Friday at 3
= reminder "Email Sarah" 2026-11-13T15:00

## half past
@lang en
> Remind me at half past six to eat
= reminder "Eat" 2026-11-10T18:30

## noon
@lang en
> Remind me tomorrow at noon to eat
= reminder "Eat" 2026-11-11T12:00

## guided
@lang en
> Remind me to buy milk
< When
= kind question
> tomorrow at 8 in the morning
= reminder "Buy milk" 2026-11-11T08:00

## cancel
@lang en
> Set a reminder
> never mind
= count reminder 0

## every weekday
@lang en
> Remind me every weekday at 7 to take my pills
= reminder "Take my pills" 2026-11-11T07:00 repeat=weekdays

## month and day
@lang en
> Remind me on December 3rd at 10 am about the birthday
= reminder "Birthday" 2026-12-03T10:00

## let me know, an hour and a half
@lang en
> Let me know in an hour and a half that the laundry is done
= reminder "Laundry is done" 2026-11-10T17:30

## quarter to
@lang en
> Remind me at quarter to six to leave
= reminder "Leave" 2026-11-10T17:45
